  "instructions": "Measured scientific-conference narration in Alloy. Calm, precise, and authoritative. Motivate the first four sentences warmly and conditionally, with no result cadence. Give the dual-channel retrieval into the magnitude-redshift evidence plane the strongest emphasis. Do not imply any catalogue count, archival gap, bright-end count, or pace result has been revealed.",
